{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12121","headline":"同李五夕次香山精舍访宪上人 · 钱起","name":"同李五夕次香山精舍访宪上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"彼岸闻山钟，仙舟过苕水。\n松门入幽映，石径趋迤逦。\n初月开草堂，远公方觏止。\n忘言在闲夜，凝念得微理。\n泠泠功德池，相与涤心耳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12121.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12121","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}